<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow chief exec to retire June 97.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow chief exec to retire June 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taylor Woodrow Plc, the UK construction to property development group, said on Tuesday that its group chief executive Tony Palmer will retire in June 1997 at the company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>The group said it will be looking for a successor inside and outside the group and expects to announce its new chief before the final results in March 1997.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
